This product provides an executable architecture reference for a method
developed from the Dinomaly reconstruction architecture:

  Dinomaly: The Less Is More Philosophy in Multi-Class Unsupervised
  Anomaly Detection, CVPR 2025.
  https://github.com/guojiajeremy/Dinomaly

Dinomaly is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The public OCLR
files implement feature-level Global/Local routes, route conditioning,
local-only Q/V LoRA, feature fusion, and the shared FP16-safe decoder block
family. The image, training, inference-aggregation, evaluation, and checkpoint
pipeline is not included.

The DINOv2 runtime dependency is developed by Meta Platforms, Inc. and
contributors and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
No DINOv2 source code or weights are redistributed here.
